      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，论对后冠赛马娘们的憧憬，我也不输给你。\n正是伟大的前人创造了历史，才有今天在这里的我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "430848f5ebb63e28c1e240bb30daa822b2ef1708edd2db4ea34e725af8d29c74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
