    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71329311a92b2b172b7119f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我也要成为，延续历史的基石。\n……作为同世代，又憧憬同一存在的对手，我们来决一胜负吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77caf06a0a4648e2a34aa037521b81bde72b49c3568d5d62bde13d7465033b25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0006/storytimeline_100006003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
