      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说的没错。西沙里奥也是……空中救主也是，勇敢之心也是！\n我绝不会输给你们。好，我要加油～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f4976bc1b402d94464c8a90ab3d2bd1e6ffd15d7c8731b5044134fca89512f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0006/storytimeline_100006003.json",
      "json_path": [
