      "uid": "zhcn:7278e741fc6273f5f0434bd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，多么地……多么地美妙啊！！\n后冠路线，为这华丽的舞台增添色彩，这些赛马娘们的光辉……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ac4e1fe40cf969e97c893763a460adad7fc47d7c1fc3972b00a62503a05b68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
