      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过去我们奔跑过的，三后冠的舞台。\n她们又会在那里，编织出怎么的故事呢――",
      "source_fingerprint": "663ae1fd0d777a4085861b02ea70fb3290bdbdbcf9388e1390caf3fc9bf2379d",
