      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇哇哇，对不起！　气槽学姐培育的花儿，\n它们――……太，太漂亮了～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46f2e063a596c654ee090e5f1d1ce8817445b3086d0d2078e260995f132a2aa2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
