    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8454d05d5f173955afe8f061",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈！　这可是后冠路线的Legend培育的，莱茵\n会被吸引住也是没办法的！　还是老样子呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40286cba115e12ff9ac3b81a085af646de0e2754be0c63673f570bfb94b95cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
